flowchart TD
 R[Enhancement or bug fix] --> SCAN[Repository scan]
 SCAN --> MAP[Module, API and dependency map]
 MAP --> IMPACT[Impacted component analysis]
 IMPACT --> PLAN[Minimal-change task DAG]
 PLAN --> PATCH[Generate isolated patch / branch]
 PATCH --> REG[Existing regression tests]
 REG --> NEW[New targeted tests]
 NEW --> DIFF[Diff and compatibility review]
 DIFF --> G{All gates pass?}
 G -->|No| FIX[Targeted fix or escalation]
 FIX --> PATCH
 G -->|Yes| HUMAN[Human review and merge approval]
